WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.634
August sixteenth, twenty twenty-six. Bloomberg reports that Stripe has agreed to acquire OpenRouter.

00:00:06.634 --> 00:00:09.932
The reported price is more than seven billion dollars.

00:00:09.932 --> 00:00:15.754
OpenRouter is the gateway developers use to reach five hundred models across eighty providers.

00:00:15.754 --> 00:00:23.693
In May it raised at a one point three billion dollar valuation. Seven billion is roughly five times that, less than three months later.

00:00:23.693 --> 00:00:29.271
But neither company has confirmed. Both declined to comment. Reported, not official.
